  "intro": {
    "title": "Ich muss los!",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Müssen = must, have to: Ich muss arbeiten. Like other modal verbs, the singular changes its vowel (ich muss) and the main verb goes to the end. Careful: nicht müssen means 'don't have to', not 'mustn't'."
    ]
  },
